{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","title":"DCA adalah strategi rata-rata biaya masuk","desc":"Definisi Dollar Cost Averaging dan aplikasinya di konteks hedge valas.","updated":1778580048061,"created":1778579633791,"tags":["til","national-finance","glossary","dca"],"custom":{},"fname":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"a2e6a8dbc18b2deaf564bf68665674b9","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","id":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.til","alias":"til","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.til"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","id":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.national-finance","alias":"national-finance","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.national-finance"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","id":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.glossary","alias":"glossary","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.glossary"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","id":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.dca","alias":"dca","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.dca"}},{"from":{"fname":"notes.national-finance.core-satellite-defensive-allocation","id":"notes.national-finance.core-satellite-defensive-allocation","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":609,"column":3,"offset":20936},"end":{"line":609,"column":53,"offset":20986},"indent":[]},"value":"til.national-finance.dca-dollar-cost-averaging"}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"mxnxcgpd2rvli5l5xetm8e7","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"dca-adalah-strategi-rata-rata-biaya-masuk\">DCA adalah strategi rata-rata biaya masuk<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#dca-adalah-strategi-rata-rata-biaya-masuk\"></a></h1>\n<p>DCA adalah singkatan dari <strong>Dollar Cost Averaging</strong>. Ini strategi investasi di mana lo membeli aset dalam jumlah tetap secara berkala, tanpa terlalu mikirin harga harian.</p>\n<p>Kalau harga naik, lo beli lebih sedikit. Kalau harga turun, lo beli lebih banyak. Tujuannya adalah mengurangi risiko salah timing pasar.</p>\n<p>Dalam konteks hedge valas, DCA bisa masuk akal kalau lo pakai batch yang cukup besar. Kalau DCA-nya terlalu kecil, biaya spread masuk-keluar bisa jadi lebih besar daripada manfaat averaging-nya.</p>\n<p>Jadi DCA bukan cuma \"beli terus setiap bulan\", tapi lebih tepatnya \"beli berkala dengan kuantitas dan frekuensi yang mempertimbangkan biaya transaksi\".</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">til (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">national-finance (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">glossary (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">dca (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.national-finance.core-satellite-defensive-allocation\">Core-satellite defensive allocation untuk hedge rupiah</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":fal